  Title: '<color=yellow>7 Deadly Sins Scavenger Hunt</color>'
  Details: '<color=yellow>What’s up, lil'' devils! The 7 Deadly Sins Scavenger hunt is ending soon! If you’re having some trouble finding some of the items, here are a few hints:</color>\n\n<color=white>-Live that high-cal life\n\n-Smite a random person on the street\n\n-Take your friend down with a rumor</color>\n\n<color=yellow>Complete the event to unlock a FREE accessory! The hunt ends on 8/4, so hurry and start sinning!</color>'
